izing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 17px;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span class=\"js_title_inner\" style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.034em; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; visibility: visible; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #007aaa;\"><strong>2026年中秋、国庆假期开放公告</strong></span></span></span></h1>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; color: #3e3e3e;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">\n<section style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 10px 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 100%; vertical-align: middle; align-self: center; flex: 0 0 auto; background-color: rgba(114, 174, 255, 0.11); padding: 25px; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<section class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75; letter-spacing: 1px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p style=\"text-indent: 0em; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">亲爱的观众朋友：</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2.125em; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">2026年中秋、国庆假期将至，为进一步满足广大观众假日期间精神文化需求，现就陕西历史博物馆中秋、国庆假期开放事宜公告如下：</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 10px 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: bottom; width: auto; align-self: flex-end; flex: 0 0 0%; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px 0px 0px 6px; border-color: #56a5d7 #56a5d7 #56a5d7 #0d50c9; height: auto; padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<section style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 0px 0px -6px; box-sizing: border-box; transform: translate3d(-6px, 0px, 0px); -webkit-transform: translate3d(-6px, 0px, 0px); -moz-transform: translate3d(-6px, 0px, 0px); -o-transform: translate3d(-6px, 0px, 0px);\">\n<section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: bottom; width: auto; flex: 0 0 0%; height: auto; line-height: 0; align-self: flex-end; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<section style=\"display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 0px; vertical-align: top; overflow: hidden; border-style: solid; border-width: 6px 0px 0px 6px; border-color: #00cafe rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); box-sizing: border-box;\" data-ignore-width=\"\">\n<section style=\"text-align: justify; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: bottom; width: auto; align-self: flex-end; flex: 0 0 auto; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px 0px 6px; border-color: #846c41 #846c41 #00cafe; line-height: 0; min-width: 5%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<section style=\"text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<section style=\"display: inline-block; width: 15px; height: 15px; vertical-align: top; overflow: hidden; box-sizing: border-box;\" data-ignore-width=\"\">\n<section style=\"text-align: justify; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: bottom; width: auto; align-self: flex-end; flex: 0 0 auto; background-color: #ebf2fa; min-width: 5%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 0px -21px; padding: 5px 14px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<section class=\"\" style=\"color: #0d50c9; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: #007aaa;\">本馆</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: #007aaa; font-weight: normal;\">（西安市雁塔区小寨东路91号）</span></strong></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: auto; flex: 0 0 0%; height: auto; margin: 6px 0px 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<section style=\";transform-style: flat; box-sizing: border-box; transform: perspective(0px); -webkit-transform: perspective(0px); -moz-transform: perspective(0px); -o-transform: perspective(0px);\">\n<section style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; box-sizing: border-box; transform: rotateX(180deg) rotateY(180deg); -webkit-transform: rotateX(180deg) rotateY(180deg); -moz-transform: rotateX(180deg) rotateY(180deg); -o-transform: rotateX(180deg) rotateY(180deg);\">\n<section style=\"display: inline-block; width: auto; vertical-align: bottom; align-self: flex-end; flex: 0 0 0%; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px 0px 0px 6px; border-color: #56a5d7 #56a5d7 #56a5d7 #0d50c9; height: auto; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<section style=\"justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 0px 0px -6px; box-sizing: border-box; transform: translate3d(-6px, 0px, 0px); -webkit-transform: translate3d(-6px, 0px, 0px); -moz-transform: translate3d(-6px, 0px, 0px); -o-transform: translate3d(-6px, 0px, 0px);\">\n<section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: bottom; width: auto; flex: 0 0 0%; height: auto; line-height: 0; align-self: flex-end; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<section style=\"display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 0px; vertical-align: top; overflow: hidden; border-style: solid; border-width: 6px 0px 0px 6px; border-color: #00cafe rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); box-sizing: border-box;\" data-ignore-width=\"\">\n<section style=\"text-align: justify; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: bottom; width: auto; align-self: flex-end; flex: 0 0 auto; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px 0px 6px; border-color: #846c41 #846c41 #00cafe; line-height: 0; min-width: 5%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<section style=\"text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<section style=\"display: inline-block; width: 15px; height: 15px; vertical-align: top; overflow: hidden; box-sizing: border-box;\" data-ignore-width=\"\">\n<section style=\"text-align: justify; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75; letter-spacing: 1px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2.125em; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">1.<span style=\"color: #007aaa;\"><strong>9月25日&mdash;9月27日及10月1日&mdash;10月7日期间，开放时间调整为7:30-20:30（19:30停止检票），参观预约数量为17500人次/日。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2.125em; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">2.开放的展览有：</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2.125em; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">①基本陈列&ldquo;陕西古代文明&rdquo;（第一、第二、第三展厅）；</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2.125em; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">②专题陈列&ldquo;大唐遗宝&mdash;&mdash;何家村窖藏出土文物展&rdquo;（第四展厅）；</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2.125em; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">③专题陈列&ldquo;唐代壁画珍品展&rdquo;（收费展，东展厅负一层），购票可参观&ldquo;壁上丹青 &nbsp;盛唐气象&mdash;&mdash;唐韩休墓壁画考古发掘与保护展&rdquo;（西展厅负一层）；</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2.125em; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">④临时展览&ldquo;文明以止&mdash;&mdash;希腊化时期的黄金艺术&rdquo;特展（收费展，第七展厅）；</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2.125em; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">⑤临时展览&ldquo;锦绣华裳&mdash;&mdash;新疆巴州博物馆藏古代服饰精品展&rdquo;（第五展厅）；</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2.125em; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">⑥临时展览&ldquo;金石学在陕西&middot;追金篇&rdquo;（第六展厅）；</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2.125em; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">⑦临时展览&ldquo;伯乐相马&rdquo;（西地下青少年教育活动中心）；</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2.125em; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">⑧临时展览&ldquo;面见唐人&mdash;&mdash;陕西唐代面食文化展&rdquo;（国宝厅）。</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2.125em; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 2.125em; caret-color: red;\">感谢您对陕西历史博物馆的关注与支持。</span></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75; letter-spacing: 1px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2.125em; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-indent: 1.875em; text-align: right;\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">来源：陕西历史博物馆</span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<section class=\"_135editor\"></section>",
